From bf497631d76be6043c1eff30c1d425797e44dc3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: probonopd <probonopd@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 19:04:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] AVFoundation: add AVCapture audio recording classes via
 libavdevice
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- AVCaptureSession — manage capture lifecycle, uses FFmpeg avdevice
  to open ALSA/OSS/Pulse input, decode with avcodec, resample to
  mono float PCM via libswresample in a background pthread
- AVCaptureDevice — enumerate audio input devices, default mic
- AVCaptureDeviceInput — connect a device to a session
- AVCaptureAudioDataOutput — callback delegate with float PCM data
- No libdispatch dependency — delegate called directly on capture thread
- GNUmakefile.preamble: add libavdevice, libswresample with fallback
---
